{"id":"nce2-002","book":"nce2","numbers":[2],"label":"Lesson 2","titleEn":"Breakfast or Lunch?","titleCn":"早餐还是午餐？","audio":"media/lessons/nce2/002.mp3","lines":[{"t":10.47,"en":"Why was the writer's aunt surprised?","cn":"为什么作者的阿姨会感到惊讶呢？"},{"t":16.0,"en":"It was Sunday.","cn":"那是星期天。"},{"t":17.99,"en":"I never get up early on Sundays.","cn":"我从来不在周日早起。"},{"t":22.03,"en":"I sometimes stay in bed until lunchtime.","cn":"有时候我会一直躺在床上，直到午餐时间才起床。"},{"t":26.81,"en":"Last Sunday I got up very late.","cn":"上周日，我起得很晚。"},{"t":31.06,"en":"I looked out of the window.","cn":"我望向了窗外。"},{"t":33.45,"en":"It was dark outside.","cn":"外面一片漆黑。"},{"t":35.84,"en":"'What a day!' I thought.","cn":"“真是美好的一天啊！”我想。"},{"t":39.6,"en":"'It's raining again.'","cn":"“又下雨了。”"},{"t":42.61,"en":"Just then, the telephone rang.","cn":"就在这时，电话响了。"},{"t":46.04,"en":"It was my aunt Lucy.","cn":"那是我的阿姨露西。"},{"t":49.04,"en":"'I've just arrived by train,' she said.","cn":"“我刚乘火车到达的，”她说。"},{"t":53.09,"en":"'I'm coming to see you.'","cn":"“我来看你了。”"},{"t":56.01,"en":"'But I'm still having breakfast,' I said.","cn":"“但我还在吃早餐呢，”我说。"},{"t":60.54,"en":"'What are you doing?' she asked.","cn":"“你在做什么？”她问。"},{"t":63.84,"en":"'I'm having breakfast,' I repeated.","cn":"“我在吃早餐，”我重复道。"},{"t":67.5,"en":"'Dear me,' she said.","cn":"“天哪，”她说。"},{"t":70.4,"en":"'Do you always get up so late?","cn":"“你总是起这么晚吗？"},{"t":73.39,"en":"It's one o'clock!'","cn":"现在都一点钟了！”"}],"words":[{"word":"until","phonetic":["ən'til","ʌn'til"],"pos":"prep.","meaning":"直到","us":"media/words/nce2/w0013_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0013_e.mp3"},{"word":"outside","phonetic":["aut'said"],"pos":"ad.","meaning":"外面","us":"media/words/nce2/w0014_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0014_e.mp3"},{"word":"ring","phonetic":["riŋ"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"(铃、电话等)响","us":"media/words/nce2/w0015_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0015_e.mp3"},{"word":"aunt","phonetic":["ɑ:nt"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"姑，姨，婶，舅妈","us":"media/words/nce2/w0016_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0016_e.mp3"},{"word":"repeat","phonetic":["ri'pi:t"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"重复","us":"media/words/nce2/w0017_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0017_e.mp3"}]}